// direct functions to set the label and its mnemonic. For more advanced label
// settings, you can fetch the child widget from the GtkBin.
//
// An example for setting markup and accelerator on a MenuItem:
//
//	menuitem
//	├── <child>
//	╰── [arrow.right]
